    "evidence": "The concentric vault/radar field, central lock, oversized editorial headline, and cyan/yellow evidence palette create a recognizable security-lab identity across all three viewports. However, the signature graphic is extremely faint and visually empty, while the lower half resolves into familiar metric cards, badges, and bordered dashboard panels; the global header also feels like a conventional dense section rail.",
